# Deliberately NOT ignored:
#   app/schemas/            Room's exported schemas are the migration record and
#                           must be committed, or a future migration cannot be
#                           validated against the shipped database.
#   gradle/wrapper/         the wrapper jar and properties pin the build.
#   fastlane/metadata/      F-Droid / store text, read from the repo by the
#                           F-Droid build server.
#   .github/workflows/      CI.
